<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Reproducibility Statement</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure the reproducibility of our work, we provide the source code in an anonymous GitHub repository available at: <a href="https://anonymous.4open.science/r/code-release-456D/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://anonymous.4open.science/r/code-release-456D/</a>.
Regarding the datasets described in Table 1 and Section 4.1, we note that the partition between the training stream (experience pool) and the test set is generated dynamically. To guarantee the exact replication of the data splits used in our experiments, our repository includes the specific random seeds and preprocessing scripts required to reconstruct these partitions.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Additional Experiments</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1. </span>Cost Efficiency Analysis</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate the cost efficiency of U-MEM against baselines regarding token consumption (using <span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Gemini-2.5-flash</span>) and training time (using <span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5-7B</span>). For token consumption (averaged token number for each instance), Figure <a href="#A2.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ B.1. Cost Efficiency Analysis ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiments ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows that while all memory agents incur overhead compared to the No Memory baseline, U-MEM is significantly more efficient than sampling-heavy methods like ReasoningBank and ReMe, which require processing parallel trajectories. Although U-MEM consumes slightly more tokens than MemRL, this investment is justified by its superior performance, avoiding the attribution errors common in MemRL’s low-cost but shallow reflection.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Regarding training time (which, for U-MEM, denotes the streaming memory acquisition phase without parameter updates), Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.1. Cost Efficiency Analysis ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiments ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> demonstrates that U-MEM consistently outperforms the RL baseline (GRPO). On the AIME benchmark, U-MEM completes memory acquisition in just 10.5 hours compared to 19.5 hours for RL fine-tuning—a near <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="2\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times</annotation></semantics></math> speedup. Similar efficiency gains are observed on AdvancedIF (2.7h vs. 9.7h) and STEM (9.3h vs. 17.6h). These results highlight U-MEM as a highly efficient, gradient-free alternative to RL, capable of continuous evolution with significantly lower computational latency.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22406v1/memory_tokens_plot.png" id="A2.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/264;" width="429" height="264" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5. </span>Comparison of average tokens usage between U-MEM, ReasoningBank, ReMe, MemRL and No Mem.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22406v1/training_time.png" id="A2.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/224;" width="429" height="224" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6. </span>Comparison of training time (GPU hours) between U-MEM and RL (GRPO). U-MEM achieves comparable or better performance with significantly reduced time costs.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide example prompts used in <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">U-Mem</span>.
First, the prompts for Memory Extraction—covering both success summarization and failure correction—are presented in Figures <a href="#A3.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, <a href="#A3.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, and <a href="#A3.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.
Second, the prompts for Memory-Augmented Inference, which integrate retrieved insights into the reasoning context, are shown in Figures <a href="#A3.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> and <a href="#A3.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.
Finally, the prompt governing Streaming Memory Maintenance (i.e., consolidation, merging, and pruning) is illustrated in Figure <a href="#A3.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Towards Autonomous Memory Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="475" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 475" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,475) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 448.46 C 0 453.26 3.9 457.16 8.7 457.16 L 468.67 457.16 C 473.48 457.16 477.38 453.26 477.38 448.46 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 448.46 C 0.83 452.81 4.36 456.33 8.7 456.33 L 468.67 456.33 C 473.02 456.33 476.55 452.81 476.55 448.46 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 449.29)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 264.12 25.71 C 266.3 25.71 268.06 23.95 268.06 21.77 L 268.06 3.94 C 268.06 1.76 266.3 0 264.12 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 264.12 25.71 C 266.3 25.71 268.06 23.95 268.06 21.77 L 268.06 3.94 C 268.06 1.76 266.3 0 264.12 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:15.31em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="243.58"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">AIME Success Memory Extraction</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 17.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:30.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="425.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 422.73)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a Logic Path Analyzer.
</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TASK:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given a successful solution trace, extract reusable high-level procedural memories that summarize the correct reasoning.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">INPUTS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question] :{question}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Successful Trace] : {reasoning}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">ANALYSIS LOGIC:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Identify the dominant solution pipeline used in the Trace.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Abstract it into transferable steps that generalize beyond this single problem.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Produce only 1 memory.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Must be transferable: each memory must state WHEN it applies (trigger condition).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Prefer actionable rules over narration.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Use the format: "Step 1: [Action]. Step 2: [Action]..." (Abstract the Teacher’s workflow).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">OUTPUT FORMAT:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your output must strictly follow the format shown below:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 1:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TITLE: &lt;short name&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">DESCRIPTION: &lt;one sentence summary&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F7.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CONTENT: Step 1: … Step 2: …</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7. </span>AIME Success Memory Extraction</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F8.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="742.2" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 742.2" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,742.2) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 714.13 C 0 718.93 3.9 722.83 8.7 722.83 L 468.67 722.83 C 473.48 722.83 477.38 718.93 477.38 714.13 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 714.13 C 0.83 718.48 4.36 722 8.7 722 L 468.67 722 C 473.02 722 476.55 718.48 476.55 714.13 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 714.96)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 23.31 C 0 25.48 1.76 27.25 3.94 27.25 L 334.53 27.25 C 336.7 27.25 338.46 25.48 338.46 23.31 L 338.46 3.94 C 338.46 1.76 336.7 0 334.53 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 23.31 C 0 25.48 1.76 27.25 3.94 27.25 L 334.53 27.25 C 336.7 27.25 338.46 25.48 338.46 23.31 L 338.46 3.94 C 338.46 1.76 336.7 0 334.53 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 10.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:19.82em;--ltx-fo-height:0.65em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="315.31"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">AIME Failure Memory Extraction (Cascade)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 17.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:49.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="691.17" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 688.4)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a Logic Path Analyzer.
</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TASK:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Compare the [Student Trace] (Failed Path) with the [Teacher Trace] (Successful Path) as paths in a decision tree.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Identify the First Bifurcation Point (where the student diverged) and generate abstract Memories to fix it.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">INPUTS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question] :{question}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Student Trace]: {reasoning}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Teacher Trace]: {reasoning_teacher}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">ANALYSIS LOGIC:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Compare Paths: Does the Student’s overall methodology (Root-to-Leaf path) match the Teacher’s?</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Determine Error Type:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   Type A (Global Strategy Failure): The Student used a completely wrong pipeline.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   Type B (Local Node Failure): The Student used the correct pipeline but made a wrong decision at a specific node due to bias, laziness, false assumption or other reasons.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Produce up to {max_items} memories TOTAL. Avoid overlap; merge if redundant.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Must be transferable: each memory must state WHEN it applies (trigger condition).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Prefer actionable rules over narration.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If Type A (Global Failure): Generate a "Global Procedural Memory"</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Goal: Define the solution process.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Format: "Step 1: [Action]. Step 2: [Action]..." (Abstract the Teacher’s workflow).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If Type B (Local Failure): Generate a "Local Corrective Memory"</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Goal: Fix the specific bad decision node.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Format: "In context [X], do not assume [Y]. Instead, perform [Z]."</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.24" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">OUTPUT FORMAT:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.25" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your output must strictly follow the format shown below:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.26" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 1:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.27" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TITLE: &lt;short name&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.28" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">DESCRIPTION: &lt;one sentence summary&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.29" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CONTENT: &lt;detailed strategy&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.30" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 2:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.31" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F8.pic1.2.31.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">…</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8. </span>AIME Failure Memory Extraction (Cascade)</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F9" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="621.67" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 621.67" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,621.67) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 595.13 C 0 599.94 3.9 603.83 8.7 603.83 L 468.67 603.83 C 473.48 603.83 477.38 599.94 477.38 595.13 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 595.13 C 0.83 599.48 4.36 603 8.7 603 L 468.67 603 C 473.02 603 476.55 599.48 476.55 595.13 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 595.96)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 325.8 25.71 C 327.98 25.71 329.74 23.95 329.74 21.77 L 329.74 3.94 C 329.74 1.76 327.98 0 325.8 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 325.8 25.71 C 327.98 25.71 329.74 23.95 329.74 21.77 L 329.74 3.94 C 329.74 1.76 327.98 0 325.8 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:19.24em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="306.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Non-verifiable Pairwise Memory Extraction</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 14.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:41.35em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="572.17" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 572.17)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an AI assistant.
</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TASK:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given an input prompt and two candidate responses, extract reusable instruction-following rules by explaining why the Better response is superior to the Worse response.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">INPUTS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Input/Prompt]: {context_text}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Better response]: {r1}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Worse response]: {r2}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">ANALYSIS LOGIC:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Identify the decisive preference axes that make the Better response superior.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Localize the key failure points in the Worse response with respect to explicit constraints in the Input.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. Convert each failure axis into a transferable conditional directive: a trigger + a concrete action that would have prevented the failure.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Return 1 to 3 rules total; merge overlapping rules.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Each rule must be conditional on a clear trigger (WHEN it applies).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">OUTPUT FORMAT:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your output must strictly follow the format shown below:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 1:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TRIGGER: The specific instruction/constraint where this rule applies (e.g., ’When asked to order items by cost’, ’When the user forbids numbered lists’).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">DIMENSION: The key failure axis (e.g., format adherence, constraint satisfaction, ordering, completeness, relevance, accuracy)</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">COMPARISON: An actionable, testable directive that improves compliance. It must be conditional on the trigger (e.g., ’When ordering is requested, sort items by the specified criterion before writing the list’).</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 2:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9. </span>Non-verifiable Pairwise Memory Extraction.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F10" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F10.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="359.11" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 359.11" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,359.11) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 332.57 C 0 337.38 3.9 341.28 8.7 341.28 L 468.67 341.28 C 473.48 341.28 477.38 337.38 477.38 332.57 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 332.57 C 0.83 336.92 4.36 340.45 8.7 340.45 L 468.67 340.45 C 473.02 340.45 476.55 336.92 476.55 332.57 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 333.4)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 352.47 25.71 C 354.65 25.71 356.41 23.95 356.41 21.77 L 356.41 3.94 C 356.41 1.76 354.65 0 352.47 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 352.47 25.71 C 354.65 25.71 356.41 23.95 356.41 21.77 L 356.41 3.94 C 356.41 1.76 354.65 0 352.47 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:20.89em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="332.38"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">AIME Solving Prompt with Retrieved Memory</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 17.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:22.15em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="309.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 306.49)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a math problem solver. Solve problems step-by-step using clear reasoning. You may be provided with relevant problem-solving strategies from past experience. Use them if they are helpful for the current problem.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">=== Retrieved Problem-Solving Strategies ===</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Strategy 1] {title_1}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Type: {Global Solution Flow|Local Correction}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Description: {description_1}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{content_1}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Strategy 2] {title_2}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Type: {Global Solution Flow|Local Correction}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Description: {description_2}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{content_2}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">...</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">=== End Strategies ===</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Problem: {question}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F10.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please put your final answer within \boxed{}.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10. </span>AIME solving Prompt with Retrieved Memory</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F11" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F11.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="276.09" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 276.09" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,276.09) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 249.55 C 0 254.36 3.9 258.25 8.7 258.25 L 468.67 258.25 C 473.48 258.25 477.38 254.36 477.38 249.55 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 249.55 C 0.83 253.9 4.36 257.42 8.7 257.42 L 468.67 257.42 C 473.02 257.42 476.55 253.9 476.55 249.55 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 250.38)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 373.26 25.71 C 375.43 25.71 377.2 23.95 377.2 21.77 L 377.2 3.94 C 377.2 1.76 375.43 0 373.26 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 21.77 C 0 23.95 1.76 25.71 3.94 25.71 L 373.26 25.71 C 375.43 25.71 377.2 23.95 377.2 21.77 L 377.2 3.94 C 377.2 1.76 375.43 0 373.26 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:22.25em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="354.05"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">AdvancedIF Solving Prompt with Retrieved Rules</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 17.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:16.15em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="226.58" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 223.47)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a helpful assistant. Please answer following open-ended problems.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If relevant, use these instruction-following rules as guidance:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preference 1: {trigger_1}. For "{dimension_1}", {comparison_1}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preference 2: {trigger_2}. For "{dimension_2}", {comparison_2}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">...</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preference K: {trigger_K}. For "{dimension_K}", {comparison_K}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F11.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Problem: {last_user_request_text}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11. </span>AdvancedIF solving Prompt with Retrieved Memory</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F12" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F12.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="816.92" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 816.92" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,816.92) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 788.85 C 0 793.65 3.9 797.55 8.7 797.55 L 468.67 797.55 C 473.48 797.55 477.38 793.65 477.38 788.85 L 477.38 8.7 C 477.38 3.9 473.48 0 468.67 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 788.85 C 0.83 793.2 4.36 796.72 8.7 796.72 L 468.67 796.72 C 473.02 796.72 476.55 793.2 476.55 788.85 L 476.55 8.7 C 476.55 4.36 473.02 0.83 468.67 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.69 789.68)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#737373;" fill="#737373" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 23.31 C 0 25.48 1.76 27.25 3.94 27.25 L 351.78 27.25 C 353.96 27.25 355.72 25.48 355.72 23.31 L 355.72 3.94 C 355.72 1.76 353.96 0 351.78 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.94 L 0 23.31 C 0 25.48 1.76 27.25 3.94 27.25 L 351.78 27.25 C 353.96 27.25 355.72 25.48 355.72 23.31 L 355.72 3.94 C 355.72 1.76 353.96 0 351.78 0 L 3.94 0 C 1.76 0 0 1.76 0 3.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.24 10.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:20.82em;--ltx-fo-height:0.65em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="331.25"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Memory Update (Refinement &amp; Consolidation)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 14.45 17.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.3em;--ltx-fo-height:55.15em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="765.89" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 763.12)" width="474.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.3em;">
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a Memory Refinement Expert.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context: An agent successfully solved a task and generated several "New STRATEGIES" as memories. During the task, it had also retrieved several "Historical Memories" to assist its reasoning.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task: You are provided with this combined subset (New STRATEGIES + Retrieved Memories). Your goal is to refine this specific pool of memories into an optimized, consolidated set of memories.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Objectives for Refinement and Consolidation:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Elimination (Redundancy Check): Identify any newly generated memories or historical memories that are completely or highly similar to others, and suggest eliminating these redundant items.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Consolidation (Merging): Identify memories that can be merged (e.g., a new memory is a more specific or general form of a historical one), and combine them into a single, more comprehensive and robust knowledge unit.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. Refinement (Optimization): If the phrasing or content of a memory is not general enough or is imprecise, modify its content to increase its transferability and value for future, similar problems.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4. Retention (Keep): Directly retain any memory that is valuable, non-redundant, and does not require merging or refinement.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your final output must be the optimal, consolidated set of strategies.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Note on Historical Memories: A retrieved historical memory might have been irrelevant to the current problem’s solution, but this does not necessarily make it useless. Evaluate all retrieved memories based on their generalizability and potential to help solve other problems in the future.</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PROBLEM THAT SUCCEED:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{question}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">AGENT’S REASONING TRAJECTORY:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{reasoning}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">NEWLY EXTRACTED ORIGINAL STRATEGIES (MEMORIES):</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{new_memories}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">RETRIEVED HISTORICAL MEMORIES:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{retrieved_memories}</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Strictly output the final refined and consolidated strategy list in this format:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 1:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TITLE: &lt;concise strategy name&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">DESCRIPTION: &lt;one sentence summary&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CONTENT: &lt;detailed transferable strategy&gt;</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.24" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MEMORY 2:</span></span>
<span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.25" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F12.pic1.2.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">…</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12. </span>Memory Update.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</article>
